# Documentation Rules

There is no Documentation Agent. Do not create one.

When documenting QA workflow, use `.cursor/docs/qa-unified-workflow.md`, `qa-workflow-contract`, and `qa-workflow`.

Do not document a guessed execution result, approval, or notification delivery.

Test Summary Report is owned by the Test Summary Agent, not by documentation rules.
